reaction "乙醇分子内脱水"
equation "CH₃CH₂OH → CH₂=CH₂ + H₂O"
summary "浓硫酸、约170℃条件下，乙醇发生分子内脱水生成乙烯。"

step "乙醇与酸催化" {
  note "浓硫酸先使羟基质子化，提高水的离去能力。"
  atom C1 C
  atom C2 C
  atom O3 O
  atom H1a H
  atom H1b H
  atom H1c H
  atom H2a H
  atom H2b H
  atom H3a H
  bond C1 C2 1
  bond C2 O3 1
  bond C1 H1a 1
  bond C1 H1b 1
  bond C1 H1c 1
  bond C2 H2a 1
  bond C2 H2b 1
  bond O3 H3a 1
}

step "β-H与水消除" {
  note "相邻碳上的H与羟基形成的水脱去，生成C=C。考试重点：约170℃生成乙烯；约140℃主要生成乙醚。"
  atom C1 C
  atom C2 C
  atom O3 O
  atom H1a H
  atom H1b H
  atom H2a H
  atom H2b H
  atom H3a H
  atom H3b H
  bond C1 C2 2
  bond C1 H1a 1
  bond C1 H1b 1
  bond C2 H2a 1
  bond C2 H2b 1
  bond O3 H3a 1
  bond O3 H3b 1
}
